{"code":"024950","name":"삼천리자전거","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"레저용장비와제품","sector_desc":"레저·스포츠 용품. 소비 경기와 계절성이 있습니다.","desc":"동사는 1979년 자전거 제조 및 판매업 목적으로 설립되었으며 1995년 코스닥에 상장되었음. 본사는 8개 지점 및 900개 이상의 대리점을 통해 이마트, 코스트코 등에 납품하는 국내 최대 자전거 기업으로 전기자전거 및 일반자전거를 공급하고 있음. 종속회사를 통해 패키지여행상품과 항공권 판매 여행사업을 영위하며, 직접판매방식으로 유통비용을 절감하여 저렴한 여행상품을 제공하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-23","n_days":300,"close":4755.0,"open":4790.0,"high":4815.0,"low":4625.0,"volume":60532,"amount":287829660.0,"ret_1d":0.3165,"gap":1.0549,"range_pct":3.9958,"ret_5":16.4015,"ret_20":7.5792,"ret_60":39.2387,"ret_120":-12.9121,"ret_250":-7.7595,"ma20":4326.0,"ma60":4273.9167,"ma120":4076.5833,"ma200":4251.8,"close_vs_ma200":11.835,"close_vs_ma60":11.2563,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":1.0,"slope_60":127.1242,"r2_60":0.2852,"slope_120":16.7556,"r2_120":0.0199,"slope_250":-14.5813,"r2_250":0.1257,"high52":7450.0,"low52":2795.0,"pos_52w":42.1053,"dd_52w":-36.1745,"mdd_1y":-55.3412,"atr14_pct":5.0774,"vol_ann_60":50.2703,"vol_avg20":38136.3,"vol_ratio20":1.5873,"vr5":1.7288,"vr20":0.1953,"amount_avg5":494690970.0,"amount_avg20":172574573.5,"amount_avg60":299932969.75,"obv_chg20":33.386,"turnover_20":6.151,"pv_eff_20":1.2322,"rsi14":66.0382,"frgn_net_5":18734.0,"inst_net_5":95078.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.1511,"inst_net_5_pct":0.7668,"smart_net_5_pct":0.9178,"frgn_net_20":-13106.0,"inst_net_20":100936.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.1057,"inst_net_20_pct":0.814,"smart_net_20_pct":0.7083,"frgn_net_60":-77406.0,"inst_net_60":427367.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.6242,"inst_net_60_pct":3.4465,"smart_net_60_pct":2.8223,"frgn_net_120":117584.0,"inst_net_120":400281.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.9483,"inst_net_120_pct":3.2281,"smart_net_120_pct":4.1763,"foreign_ratio":2.16,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.8,"smart_buy_streak":6,"op_income_q":33.0,"op_margin_q":6.6132,"op_qoq":43.4783,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-45.9016,"rev_yoy":1.8367,"op_trend_4q":-18.3333,"fin_period":"202606","roe":5.68,"debt_ratio":60.38,"per":11.01,"pbr":0.56,"div_yield":2.1,"fore